---
description: Load DevHarness Kit memory context before development.
alwaysApply: true
---

Before development, prefer `.agents/memory/exports/CURRENT_CONTEXT.md` as the short project context.
If it is missing or stale, run `.agents/skills/devharness-java-development/scripts/memory-export.* --task "<task>"`.
If memory is not initialized, run the memory init script first.
Do not rely on chat history as project memory.
